    "description": "Are you a skilled Senior Property Advisor looking for your next big career move? Omkar Realtors South Asia Partners in Howrah offers you the perfect platform to grow professionally and personally.\n\nAbout Omkar Realtors South Asia Partners:\nOmkar Realtors South Asia Partners is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Source and close property deals with prospective buyers and investors\n• Coordinate with architects, contractors, and project teams\n• Prepare presentations and proposals for institutional clients\n• Manage relationships with existing customers post-purchase\n• Manage RERA documentation and compliance requirements\n• Coordinate with legal teams for documentation and title verification\n• Achieve monthly and quarterly sales targets\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• MBA from a recognized university\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in CRM Software\n• Proficiency in Due Diligence\n• Proficiency in Market Research\n• Proficiency in RERA Compliance\n• Proficiency in Client Relationship Management\n• Proficiency in Contract Management\n• Proficiency in Lease Administration\n• Proficiency in Project Management\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Recognition and rewards programs\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Learning & development budget\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Howrah, West Bengal, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Omkar Realtors South Asia Partners!",
